{
  "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.46,
      "size": 71424,
      "text": "拿起一片薯片仔细看，它沿一个方向向上弯，沿垂直的方向却向下弯。这种两头翘中间凹的形状，数学上叫双曲抛物面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.27,
      "size": 68256,
      "text": "它的方程简单得出人意料：z 等于 x 的平方减去 y 的平方，各自再除以一个系数。一个加号变成减号，碗就变成了马鞍。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.68,
      "size": 42912,
      "text": "今天要讲的重点不是它的形状，而是藏在这个弯曲曲面里的一个反直觉事实。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "saddle",
      "line_id": "sad-1",
      "filename": "saddle-sad-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/saddle-sad-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.31,
      "size": 68976,
      "text": "先看弯曲方式。沿着 x 方向切一刀，截面是一条开口向上的抛物线。沿着 y 方向切，截面是开口向下的抛物线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "saddle",
      "line_id": "sad-2",
      "filename": "saddle-sad-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/saddle-sad-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.92,
      "size": 62640,
      "text": "两个主方向的弯曲符号相反，乘起来就是负数。这个乘积叫高斯曲率，负的高斯曲率就意味着这一点是鞍点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "saddle",
      "line_id": "sad-3",
      "filename": "saddle-sad-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/saddle-sad-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.09,
      "size": 65520,
      "text": "关键在于，这张曲面上没有任何一点例外。每一点的高斯曲率都是负的，所以它处处都是鞍点，没有碗形的地方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "ruled",
      "line_id": "rul-1",
      "filename": "ruled-rul-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/ruled-rul-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.53,
      "size": 56448,
      "text": "现在看反直觉的部分。这张明显弯曲的曲面，居然可以被一族笔直的直线完全铺满，一根都不弯。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "ruled",
      "line_id": "rul-2",
      "filename": "ruled-rul-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/ruled-rul-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.55,
      "size": 56736,
      "text": "更惊人的是，这样的直线族不只一族，而是整整两族。画面上黄色和青色的两组线就是它们。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "ruled",
      "line_id": "rul-3",
      "filename": "ruled-rul-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/ruled-rul-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.63,
      "size": 58032,
      "text": "曲面上每一点都恰好有两条直线穿过，一条来自第一族，一条来自第二族。这种曲面叫双直纹面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "proof",
      "line_id": "prf-1",
      "filename": "proof-prf-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/proof-prf-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.72,
      "size": 75456,
      "text": "为什么会这样？换一组参数就一目了然。令 x 等于 a 乘 s 加 t，y 等于 b 乘 s 减 t，那么 z 恰好等于四倍的 s 乘 t。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "proof",
      "line_id": "prf-2",
      "filename": "proof-prf-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/proof-prf-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "size": 54144,
      "text": "现在固定 t 不动，只让 s 变化。三个坐标都是 s 的一次函数，这就是一条直线的标准形式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "proof",
      "line_id": "prf-3",
      "filename": "proof-prf-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/proof-prf-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.44,
      "size": 55008,
      "text": "反过来固定 s 让 t 变化，同样得到一次函数，也是直线。两种固定方式就给出了两族直线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "apply",
      "line_id": "app-1",
      "filename": "apply-app-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/apply-app-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.4,
      "size": 54432,
      "text": "这个性质在建筑上极其有用。想盖一个漂亮的曲面屋顶，却不想定制昂贵的弯曲构件，怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "apply",
      "line_id": "app-2",
      "filename": "apply-app-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/apply-app-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.94,
      "size": 63072,
      "text": "答案就是用双曲抛物面。整个屋顶用笔直的钢梁或木梁按两族方向交叉搭起来，成品却是一张优雅的曲面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "apply",
      "line_id": "app-3",
      "filename": "apply-app-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/apply-app-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.99,
      "size": 63792,
      "text": "请拖动两个系数滑块，看曲面如何在不同比例间变化。无论怎么调，那两族直线始终存在，这是它的固有性质。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.49,
      "size": 39888,
      "text": "第一，双曲抛物面的高斯曲率处处为负，所以它每一点都是鞍点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.67,
      "size": 42768,
      "text": "第二，它是双直纹面，能被两族直线完全铺满，每点恰有两条直线穿过。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-paraboloid",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-paraboloid/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.07,
      "size": 49104,
      "text": "第三，正因如此，弯曲的屋顶可以用笔直的梁搭出来。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
